OL,3,GNEWSAStephen Fry sends message of
OL,4,Asupport to film festival
OL,5,
OL,6,FSir Stephen Fry has sent a message of
OL,7,Fsupport to a festival celebrating
OL,8,Fup-and-coming film-makers.
OL,10,FFakenham Film Festival will bring
OL,11,Ftogether short productions from local
OL,12,Findependent makers and feature films
OL,13,Fwith a Norfolk connection, at the event
OL,14,Fwhich runs from Friday 2 to Sunday 4
OL,15,FOctober.
OL,17,FAmong the line-up is Fry's 2003 film
OL,18,FBright Young Things, which he directed
OL,19,Fand scripted as an adaptation of Vile
OL,20,FBodies written by Evelyn Waugh.
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
