OL,3,GNEWSAStephen Fry sends message of
OL,4,Asupport to film festival
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn his message he said: "I really am
OL,7,Fdelighted this is taking place. It is
OL,8,Fvery good for Fakenham and very good
OL,9,Ffor Norfolk."
